flowchart TD
    Start([User Action]) --> ValidateInput{Valid Input?}
    ValidateInput -->|No| ErrorResponse[Return Error]
    ValidateInput -->|Yes| CheckCache{Cache Hit?}

    CheckCache -->|Yes| ReturnCached[Return Cached Data]
    CheckCache -->|No| LoadFromDB[Load from Database]

    LoadFromDB --> CheckExists{Exists?}
    CheckExists -->|No| CreateDefault[Create Default Preferences]
    CheckExists -->|Yes| MergeData[Merge with Updates]

    CreateDefault --> CacheData[Cache Data]
    MergeData --> ValidatePrefs{Valid Preferences?}

    ValidatePrefs -->|No| ErrorResponse
    ValidatePrefs -->|Yes| UpdateDB[Update Database]

    UpdateDB --> InvalidateCache[Invalidate Cache]
    InvalidateCache --> AddHistory[Add History Entry]
    AddHistory --> EmitEvent[Emit preference_updated Event]
    EmitEvent --> CacheData

    CacheData --> ReturnData[Return Updated Data]
    ReturnCached --> End([Response])
    ReturnData --> End
    ErrorResponse --> End

    style Start fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style End fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style ValidateInput fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1565C0,color:#fff
    style CheckCache fill:#FF9800,stroke:#E65100,color:#fff
    style ValidatePrefs fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1565C0,color:#fff
    style CheckExists fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1565C0,color:#fff
    style ErrorResponse fill:#F44336,stroke:#C62828,color:#fff
